======================

The MIT terms above cover this repository's own source code, notebooks, and
documentation. They do not cover the redistributed third-party artifacts in
`vendor/`, each of which remains under its own licence:

  iterative_stratification-0.1.9-py3-none-any.whl   BSD 3-Clause
